ive one makes the browser drop"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the registration entirely, and silently. The theme writes the "},{"t":"code","text":"rem"},{"t":"text","text":" value in the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rule below."}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"tip","caption":"One `cssVars` for the theme and for a component","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The same "},{"t":"code","text":"cssVars"},{"t":"text","text":" declares a design system's theme and a single component's"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"styling API — per-instance variants, inheritance, forwarding, runtime values."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"See "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/components/css-variables","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Typed CSS variables"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"seal-—-closing-a-tree","children":[{"t":"code","text":"seal"},{"t":"text","text":" — closing a tree"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"seal(node)"},{"t":"text","text":" is the only place a "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/style/obligations","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"context obligation"}]},{"t":"text","text":" becomes"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"an error. Up to that point an unanswered requirement keeps travelling, because an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"ancestor still has the right to answer it. "},{"t":"code","text":"seal"},{"t":"text","text":" is you saying: from here up,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nobody else will."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Put it at the root of a route, not around the component that raised the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"requirement — that is the whole point of letting obligations travel."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"next","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Next"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragrap